{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bittersweet Birthday",
    "steam_appid": 1581100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/2d7da9396ff1f7672110580f23a9e8fa.avif?t=1753170950\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up...dazed, and with no memories. As you ask yourself where you are and how you got there, a strange voice breaks through the speaker system offering you a way out. Unstable individuals are hunting you down and it looks like your only chance of escape...is to listen...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.webm?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bittersweet Birthday is a mindbending, story-driven action RPG where every combat encounter is a challenging and unique boss fight. Learn your enemy's patterns, plan your movements and tear down your opponent in fierce battles that combine Soulslike dodge roll mechanics with bullet hell mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.webm?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.mp4?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.apng?t=1753170950\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside of battle, uncover the mysteries surrounding your past through exploration and a colorful cast of characters. Complete side quests and discover secret items to unlock Memories that affect your style of combat. Good or bad, use these mementos to lighten the load or add extra challenge to your encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the traumas and the broken memories, gather up the pieces of your past and get ready... You've got a birthday party to attend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of mystery driven by endearing characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lively village with friendly residents and interlocking quests ready to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punishing combat where reading the enemy is the key to victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darts mini-game! Well, darts are being used, at least...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Gachapon machine with 48 collectibles up for grabs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn pixel-art with beautifully designed backgrounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully re-mappable input and support for PlayStation, Xbox, and PC controllers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dog!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.webm?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.mp4?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/2d7da9396ff1f7672110580f23a9e8fa.avif?t=1753170950\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up...dazed, and with no memories. As you ask yourself where you are and how you got there, a strange voice breaks through the speaker system offering you a way out. Unstable individuals are hunting you down and it looks like your only chance of escape...is to listen...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.webm?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bittersweet Birthday is a mindbending, story-driven action RPG where every combat encounter is a challenging and unique boss fight. Learn your enemy's patterns, plan your movements and tear down your opponent in fierce battles that combine Soulslike dodge roll mechanics with bullet hell mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.webm?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.mp4?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.apng?t=1753170950\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside of battle, uncover the mysteries surrounding your past through exploration and a colorful cast of characters. Complete side quests and discover secret items to unlock Memories that affect your style of combat. Good or bad, use these mementos to lighten the load or add extra challenge to your encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Among the traumas and the broken memories, gather up the pieces of your past and get ready... You've got a birthday party to attend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of mystery driven by endearing characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lively village with friendly residents and interlocking quests ready to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punishing combat where reading the enemy is the key to victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darts mini-game! Well, darts are being used, at least...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Gachapon machine with 48 collectibles up for grabs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn pixel-art with beautifully designed backgrounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully re-mappable input and support for PlayStation, Xbox, and PC controllers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dog!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.poster.avif?t=1753170950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.webm?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.mp4?t=1753170950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
